    "imageSrc": "https://www.assimalhakeem.net/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/shahada1.jpg",
    "postDate": "2017-03-21",
    "postExcerpt": "Last time, we spoke about three of the ayahs with which the author began Chapter 1. Now we move on to the fourth location that he mentioned. Allah ‘azza wa jal says: “Worship Allah and join none with Him (in worship)…” [Surat an-Nisa (4): 36] This ayah is in Surat an-Nisa. It is a long [&hellip;]",
