    "postExcerpt": "Usually, in strategic planning, the experts say that first you have to set your objectives because if you fail to set your objectives, you will fail in planning. Every Muslim has an objective and his sole objective is to avoid Hellfire and to be admitted into Jannah {May Allah make you and me among [&hellip;]",
