    "postDate": "2015-02-25",
    "postExcerpt": "The prophet (salla Allahu alaihi wa sallam) once said that the people most afflicted, and effected by trials, tribulations and calamities are the prophets (peace be upon them), after them are those who are lesser than them in virtue and righteousness. The prophet (salla Allahu alaihi wa sallam) said a person would be tested [&hellip;]",
