    "postDate": "2014-11-18",
    "postExcerpt": "Listen carefully and imagine your position on this earth. Many of us feel arrogant, strong, fit, vicious, rich, powerful, influential, deviant, devious and satanic! We feel like we have so much in us; we are so strong, we can do things, we can change the whole world! You are nothing, with all due respect; [&hellip;]",
