    "id": 7715,
    "type": "blog",
    "slug": "be-positive",
    "title": "&#8220;Be Positive&#8221;",
    "image": "https://www.assimalhakeem.net/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/be-positive.jpg",
    "date": "2014-11-08",
    "excerpt": "Always think positive of Allah and hope for the best. Allah’s favors and blessings upon us are beyond count. A wise man is a person who enjoys everyday, once at a time. Today is a new day. Don’t spoil it by worrying about the future. Enjoy your day to the fullest as long [&hellip;]",
    "description": "Always think positive of Allah and hope for the best. Allah’s favors and blessings upon us are beyond count. A wise man is a person who enjoys everyday, once at a time. Today is a new day. Don’t spoil it by worrying about the future. Enjoy your day to the fullest as long as you don’t disobey Allah. Be happy and make people around you happy. Live your day with a smile on your face. Remember, what Allah has destined 50,000 years before creating the creation will happen whether you worry or not.",
    "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Always think  positive of Allah and hope for the best. Allah’s favors and blessings upon us are beyond count. A wise man is a person who enjoys everyday, once at a time. Today is a new day. Don’t spoil it by worrying about the future. Enjoy your day to the fullest as long as you don’t disobey Allah. Be happy and make people around you happy. Live your day with a smile on your face. Remember, what Allah has destined 50,000 years before creating the creation will happen whether you worry or not.</p>\n",
