    "postExcerpt": "Usually a reminder after Fajr is not very well comprehended, but I believe in this country the people insha’Allah are used to going to work and doing their activities. So insha’Allah we will not take a lot of time. Yanni, insha’Allah an hour and a half will be more than enough. I’ll make it [&hellip;]",
