    "postExcerpt": "Today we are talking about the legacy of the Prophets and the Messengers of Allah Salla Allahu alaihi wa sallam but the problem is, each aspect requires a number of dedicated lectures and to squeeze 3 great Messengers and Prophets of Allah in one lecture and to speak about these topics would not give it [&hellip;]",
