    "postDate": "2014-03-24",
    "postExcerpt": "Before we go into defining As-Sakeenah as Muslims we read the Quran and we read the Sunnah and we are astonished by a lot of the things we go through. Tell me what makes Ibraheem who is a young boy, a young man, what gives him the courage to demolish, to destroy the idols [&hellip;]",
