    "postExcerpt": "It was reported in Sahih Imam Muslim, that Jabir Ibn Abdullah (May Allah be pleased with him) Amir’s Father, Narrated that the Prophet (SAW) said: “None of you should die but believing well in Allah, but believing positively in Allah (AZ)”. The Hadith on the surface is an instruction and order from the prophet [&hellip;]",
