    "postExcerpt": "Dear brothers and sisters in Islam, the longest Aya in the Qur’an is known as Ayat ud Dain: {The Debtor of the Loan]. Lending people money is part of the permissible transactions in Islam. It varies from being Mandatory to forbidden. So it can be recommended; it also can be not recommended; and [&hellip;]",
