    "postExcerpt": "Bismillahi Rahman ar -Rahim Alhamdullilahi rabil alameen. Wa sallalaahu wa sallam wa Barak ala maboothi rahmatan lil alameen. Nabiyeena Muhammadan wa ala alihi wa sahbihi ajmaeen, ama baad, Usually when the lecturer gives a lecture or a talk at the end of the day, it is the worst lecture. And I am not [&hellip;]",
